            AnswerClientEn = "With BuildSmart, you avoid the nightmare of managing tradesmen, logistics, and communication. You never deal directly with the workers or schedule coordination - you interact solely with the app. We manage the entire process start to finish, including materials delivery, transport, cleanup, and technical oversight. Plus, there are zero advance payments; you only pay when a task is completed.",
            AnswerContractorBg = "Ние гарантираме Вашето плащане за всяка завършена задача. Клиентът депозира средствата в платформата преди старта на работата. Щом завършите задачата и тя бъде одобрена, средствата се превеждат автоматично към Вас. Без чакане на опашки, без бавене на плащания и без риск от недобросъвестни клиенти.",
            AnswerContractorEn = "We guarantee your payment for every completed task. The client deposits the funds into the platform before you start working. Once the task is finished and approved, the funds are automatically transferred to you. No payment delays, and zero risk of bad debt from clients."
